---
/**
 * The seven areas of the Jisc code, laid out like the ETEC 522 portfolio's
 * timeline: a rule down the left, a dot for each area and a card beside it.
 * The rule is neutral rather than blue so it still shows on the royal-blue
 * page theme; the blue lives inside the cards, which are always white.
 */
---

<div class="not-prose relative my-8">
	<span
		class="absolute bottom-3 left-[7px] top-3 w-0.5 rounded-full bg-stone-300 dark:bg-zinc-700"
		aria-hidden="true"
	></span>
	<ol class="space-y-5">
		<slot />
	</ol>
</div>
